2026-02-17 Douglas R. Reno <renodr at linuxfromscratch dot org>
  * Updated the Exim systemd unit to use 15 minutes for the mail queue
    processing time. This matches both the book and the SysV bootscript.
  * Updated the slapd systemd unit to provide man page pointers, consistent
    with upstream's systemd unit.

2025-12-04 Douglas R. Reno <renodr at linuxfromscratch dot org>
  * Significant changes to the ISC Kea services. This fixes several bugs,
    including the units not being uninstalled correctly when running
    "make uninstall-kea-dhcpd", the runtime directory for all of the
    services getting deleted anytime a service was stopped, and also
    some general cleanups. I've also removed the mysql.service dependency
    since at this point, everything should be using mariadb.service instead.

2024-12-09 Bruce Dubbs <bdubbs@linuxfromscratch.org>
